<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45000" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρυθμ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rhythmical order</i> or
				<i>movement</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ ῥυθμὸν εὐρυθμίαν παραδιδόναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					522a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				326b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ περὶ τὴν λέξιν εὐ</span>.
				<i>the measured cadences</i> of language, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				5.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κυκλικὴ εὐ. τῶν περιόδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					6.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>harmony</i> between the orator and his hearers, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.45e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of persons,
				<i>gracefulness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				400d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δ᾽ εὐ. τό τ᾽ ἦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Damox.
					3.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τῶν σωμάτων</span>
			<i>graceful movement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.8c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				1.10.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. χειρέων</span>
			<i>delicacy</i> of touch, in a surgeon, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.67e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
